{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and unveil the secrets of an old New Orleans mansion. Investigate your daughter disappearance and unravel the mysteries of a voodoo cult whose interest seems to be revolving around her.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.poster.avif?t=1771053898\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.webm?t=1771053898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/ada38060e4f4a9e4ad2dd87e0c89d9f3.mp4?t=1771053898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The BOUNDS VR</strong> is an adventure game infused with fantasy, horror, and a touch of action. Experience the unmatched immersion of VR and step into a story filled with mystery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.poster.avif?t=1771053898\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.webm?t=1771053898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415410/extras/50e27de53d5cfe4e3fe06df386046d3b.mp4?t=1771053898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Follow <strong>Baron Samedi</strong> throughout your journey. But is he a friend\u2026 or is he leading you into the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, puzzles and combat... Will you be strong enough to survive <strong>The BOUNDS VR</strong> and\u00a0 face the truth?<br><br><span clas